visional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m032-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"祭仲","kind":"person","person_id":"om8_gee_15k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m032-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"突","kind":"person","person_id":"mpf_qq9_bqk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m032-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"w44_37v_bcb_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m032-0044","start":44,"end":47,"surface":"湣公捷","kind":"person","person_id":"w44_37v_bcb_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","book_id":"b-shiji-038","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:p034","text":"十年夏，宋伐魯，戰於乘丘，魯生虜宋南宮萬。宋人請萬，萬歸宋。十一年秋，湣公與南宮萬獵，因博爭行，湣公怒，辱之，曰：「始吾敬若；今若，魯虜也。」萬有力，病此言，遂以局殺湣公于蒙澤。大夫仇牧聞之，以兵造公門。萬搏牧，牧齒著門闔死。因殺太宰華督，乃更立公子游爲君。諸公子奔蕭，公子御說奔亳。萬弟南宮牛將兵圍亳。冬，蕭及宋之諸公子共擊殺南宮牛，弒宋新君游而立湣公弟御說，是爲桓公。宋萬奔陳。宋人請以賂陳。陳人使婦人飲之醇酒，以革裹之，歸宋。宋人醢萬也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m034-0016","start":16,"end":20,"surface":"宋南宮萬","kind":"person","person_id":"13u_gnj_7au","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m034-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"萬","kind":"person","person_id":"13u_gnj_7au","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m034-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"萬","kind":"person","person_id":"13u_gnj_7au","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m034-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"湣公","kind":"person","person_id":"w44_37v_bcb_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m034-0038","start":38,"end":41,"surface":"南宮萬","kind":"person","person_id":"13u_gnj_7au","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m034-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"湣公","kind":"person","person_id":"w44_37v_bcb_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m034-0071","start":7